                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "Hi Dragon.  Ghostship aftermath is playable and being enjoyed by many.  have you confirmed you are using the 1.1 update?  This game has had has some major fixes which addresses your points such as :\n\nNo player clipping, key rebinds for sprint, light etc, pause button, better AI, escape confirmation screen, map and hud/fov reworked for better feel & combat, loading screens etc (see change logs).  \n\nThe only few bugs now remaining in the latest update are available in the bug report.  Have you read the Manual and the FAQ?\n\nTo keep the review relevant to the game we have now and not the release version I would ask that you could confirm any \"Current issues\" in your review.  We have had 3 major updates in the first week, and the next is due in just over a weeks time which will offer a new options screen and better AI.  It is fine if you don't like the game, but I do hope you will update your review to reflect the current state of the game.",
